pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: "3:55–4:40 设计哲学：三句话递进，第三句（把真实剧组的分工搬进 Agent）是核心，放慢语速，说完带出下一页架构图。"
elements:
  - elementId: p-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 300, 16]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: DESIGN PHILOSOPHY
  - elementId: p-pageno
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 40, 40, 16]
    content:
      style: "$pagemeta"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: "04"
  - elementId: p-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 62, 400, 44]
    content:
      style: "$header"
      wrap: false
      text: 设计哲学
  - elementId: p-side-mark
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 128, 56, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  # 01
  - elementId: p-n1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 168, 70, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 30
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      wrap: false
      text: "01"
  - elementId: p-h1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 168, 680, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      wrap: false
      text: 一句 logline，就是全部输入
  - elementId: p-b1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 202, 690, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$sub"
      wrap: false
      text: 让任何人都能尽可能方便地产出自己的短片。
  - elementId: p-r1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 244, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  # 02
  - elementId: p-n2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 268, 70, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 30
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      wrap: false
      text: "02"
  - elementId: p-h2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 268, 680, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      wrap: false
      text: 想参与创作时，每一步都为你留了位置
  - elementId: p-b2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 302, 690, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$sub"
      wrap: false
      text: 流水线全程可介入、可裁决，人的创意在关键环节最大限度发挥。
  - elementId: p-r2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 344, 840, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$line"}
  # 03
  - elementId: p-n3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 368, 70, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 30
      bold: true
      color: "$primary"
      wrap: false
      text: "03"
  - elementId: p-h3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 368, 720, 28]
    content:
      fontSize: 22
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      wrap: false
      text: 把真实剧组的分工，搬进 Agent
  - elementId: p-b3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [150, 402, 750, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$sub"
      wrap: false
      text: 编剧、分镜、提词、拍摄、质检、重拍、剪辑——每个环节由独立的 Agent 承担。
  - elementId: p-bottom
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 470, 840, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 12
      color: "$faint"
      letterSpacing: 1
      wrap: false
      text: 我们最想复刻的，不是某个功能，而是拍电影这件事本身的流水线。
